(HOME/'STATUS.md').write_text('STATE: Stage5 compatible-reference history closure proved locally;13312 transports/192 stopped trees PASS; A057 Section1 independently accepted; v3 review pending; FEI OPEN.\nNEXT: Pay exact rare/rare signed entropy excess from one unused terminal-child surplus with carried references; retain both seed bills; A091/A090 review v3.\n',encoding='utf-8')
